# Every file in this project is written with LF endings, and the Projects root is
# Drive-synced to both laptops, so a checkout must not rewrite the tree as CRLF.
# (git on this machine had core.autocrlf=true; .gitattributes travels with the repo.)
* text=auto eol=lf
# A Windows batch file keeps CRLF (the same rule life-rpg uses).
*.bat text eol=crlf
